B.b6z=new A.t("church","Deep riddle #948 \u2014 I am bread and wine yet become something greater in belief. What am I?","Communion")
B.aXT=new A.t("church","[Set 31] Whispered on knees, answered in seasons; I move mountains slowly. What am I?","Prayer")
B.b26=new A.t("church","Challenge 950: I have no voice but every hymn passes through me. What am I?","A choir loft")
B.b6q=new A.t("logic","Deep riddle #951 \u2014 The more you take from me, the larger I become. What am I?","A hole")
